# openvpn/client.conf.template — Profil client VPN (à personnaliser par utilisateur)
client
dev tun
proto udp
remote vpn.exemple-cdsi.local 1194
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
remote-cert-tls server
cipher AES-256-GCM
auth SHA256
verb 3
<ca> ... </ca>
<cert> ... </cert>
<key> ... </key>
<tls-crypt> ... </tls-crypt>
